  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Johnny K. Wu A native Clevelander raised in Central America, Johnny K. Wu is an award-winning producer, director and editor for over 25 years. H earned his MBA from Cleveland State University specializing in marketing and branding. Johnny is fluent in Chinese, Spanish and English. His media/event production company Media Design Imaging was founded in 1998 with a combined of 60+ years of experience, providing video and event producing to non and for profit corporates, small businesses and filmmaking community. He is well known and respected within the..."
    ]
